      <section class="panel quote-card"><div><div class="panel-head"><span class="eyebrow">MARGIN NOTE / 03</span><span class="tiny">AUTHOR UNKNOWN</span></div><div class="quote-mark">“</div><blockquote>Absence is not an empty space. It is a space with its own record.</blockquote></div><cite>RECOVERED FROM AN UNDATED COPY // SOURCE NOT VERIFIED</cite></section>
