    <div class="marquee"><span>DO NOT ASSUME THE ORDER IS CHRONOLOGICAL · THE INDEX DOES NOT GUARANTEE COMPLETENESS · SOME ENTRIES MAY BE MISFILED · DO NOT ASSUME THE ORDER IS CHRONOLOGICAL · THE INDEX DOES NOT GUARANTEE COMPLETENESS · SOME ENTRIES MAY BE MISFILED · </span></div>`;
  }
  function indexPage(){
    return `${heading("DIRECTORY / 01","The index.","A list of what the archive is willing to admit exists. Filter the entries. Follow a reference. Keep in mind that an index can be wrong without technically lying.","IDX-01")}
